        "ref": "dsn_7a3dfa4878f4a8153a76c41a",
        "quotedText": "2 Details of Data Incident. Notifications will describe, to the extent possible, details of the Data Incident, including steps taken to mitigate the potential risks and steps Alaio recommends Administrator take to address the Data Incident.",
        "structuralPath": "document.list_item_(c)~3.list_item_78",
        "charRange": [
